### 🟠 MEDIUM — `rag/evaluate.py`:235

**Issue:** The code mixes pathlib.Path objects (REPORTS_DIR) with os.path functions (os.makedirs, open), which can lead to type inconsistencies and potential failures on Windows where pathlib handles separators differently than os.path in some edge cases.

