### 🟠 MEDIUM — `rag/tools/ai_review.py`:277

**Issue:** The script passes the local file path of the report to `gh pr comment --body-file`. If the `output` path is user-controlled via `--output` and points to a file containing sensitive data or malicious content, it will be posted publicly to the PR. Additionally, if the path contains special characters, it might cause issues with the subprocess call.

